AVA WorkBuddy is an independent community integration, not an official Tencent
or AntV product.

The expert archive bundles the unmodified skills/ava directory from antvis/AVA
at commit d09b06d0a90e6beb8e5ac4cbdca55b8a70691f0f on codex/ava-skill-reports.
https://github.com/antvis/AVA/tree/d09b06d0a90e6beb8e5ac4cbdca55b8a70691f0f/skills/ava
Its report helper, template, icon and MIT terms are included together in the
Skill assets directory. The source reference and archive SHA-256 are recorded
in expert/ava-skill.json. No modified copy is maintained here.

public/avatars/expert.png is an original AI-generated data analyst illustration
created for this integration with OpenAI ImageGen, resized to 512x512 for the
WorkBuddy expert avatar. It does not reuse the AntV logo.
